  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Road Rehabilitation Program in Response to Hurricane Sandy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Rehabilitacion Vial de Emergencia en Respuesta a Huracan Sandy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El programa suministrar recursos para financiar obras de reparacin y estabilizacin de caminos, tareas de limpieza, la adquisicin y contratacin de obras y servicios, y apoyo institucional relacionado con la ejecucin de las obras de emergencia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will provide resources to finance road repair and stabilization works, cleaning tasks, the purchase of goods and services and institutional support related to the implementation of the emergency works.</narrative>
  </description>
